  "instructions": [
    "Chop the eggplant into small cubes and salt it to remove excess moisture.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a non-stick pan and fry the eggplant until browned and crispy.",
    "Add the chopped onion, capers, and green olives to the pan and cook until the onion is translucent.",
    "Stir in the raspberry jam, tandoor seasoning, salt, and black pepper. Cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Serve the caponata at room temperature or chilled, garnished with fresh parsley if desired.",
    "Refrigerate any leftovers for up to 3 days.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed before serving."
